{"id":"vd-a2-the-music-experiment","level":"a2","n":17,"title":{"en":"I Bet the Rap Plants Will Win","vi":"Tớ cá là cây nghe rap sẽ thắng"},"summary":"Ngày đầu thí nghiệm, Priya và Kofi đứng trước sáu chậu đậu và thi nhau đoán xem cây nào sẽ lớn nhanh nhất.","source":{"type":"story","id":"st-a2-the-music-experiment","level":"a2","title":{"en":"The Music Experiment","vi":"Thí nghiệm âm nhạc"}},"scene":{"background":"classroom","props":[{"id":"plant-pot","x":800},{"id":"notebook","x":1010,"y":640,"scale":0.8}]},"cast":{"priya":{"name":{"en":"Priya","vi":"Priya"},"look":"teengirl","x":500,"style":{"hair":"long","hairColor":"#1F1A1C","skin":"#C98E68","skinShade":"#B07650","outfit":"uniform","top":"#6C5CE7","topShade":"#5A4BD1"}},"kofi":{"name":{"en":"Kofi","vi":"Kofi"},"look":"teenboy","x":1180,"style":{"hair":"short","hairColor":"#1F1A1C","skin":"#7A4A2E","skinShade":"#643A22","outfit":"uniform","top":"#6C5CE7","topShade":"#5A4BD1"}}},"lines":[{"speaker":"kofi","en":"So, which plants will grow faster?","vi":"Vậy cây nào sẽ lớn nhanh hơn?","ipa":["soʊ","wɪtʃ","plænts","wɪl","ɡɹoʊ","ˈfæstɚ"],"start":0.554,"end":2.534,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,0.554],[1,1.066],[2,1.256],[3,1.596],[4,1.718],[5,1.936]]},{"speaker":"priya","en":"I think the classical music plants will win.","vi":"Tớ nghĩ mấy cây nghe nhạc cổ điển sẽ thắng.","ipa":["aɪ","θɪŋk","ðə","ˈklæsɪkəl","ˈmjuzɪk","plænts","wɪl","wɪn"],"start":3.324,"end":5.764,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,3.324],[1,3.457],[2,3.661],[3,3.77],[4,4.395],[5,4.748],[6,5.142],[7,5.332]]},{"speaker":"kofi","en":"No way. I bet the rap plants will win.","vi":"Không đời nào. Tớ cá là mấy cây nghe rap sẽ thắng.","ipa":["noʊ","weɪ","aɪ","bɛt","ðə","ɹæp","plænts","wɪl","wɪn"],"start":6.554,"end":8.914,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,6.554],[1,6.682],[2,7.362],[3,7.457],[4,7.674],[5,7.769],[6,8.068],[7,8.435],[8,8.612]]},{"speaker":"priya","en":"Why?","vi":"Sao vậy?","ipa":["waɪ"],"start":9.704,"end":10.194,"expression":"confused","timing":[[0,9.704]]},{"speaker":"kofi","en":"Rap is full of energy. They'll probably dance!","vi":"Rap tràn đầy năng lượng. Chắc chúng sẽ nhảy múa luôn!","ipa":["ɹæp","ɪz","fʊl","ʌv","ˈɛnɚdʒi","ðeɪl","ˈpɹɑbəˌbli","dæns"],"start":10.984,"end":13.844,"expression":"happy","gesture":"cheer","timing":[[0,10.984],[1,11.302],[2,11.425],[3,11.737],[4,11.846],[5,12.77],[6,12.892],[7,13.313]]},{"speaker":"priya","en":"Kofi, plants don't have ears.","vi":"Kofi, cây làm gì có tai.","ipa":["ˈkoʊfi","plænts","doʊnt","hæv","ɪɹz"],"start":14.634,"end":16.654,"gesture":"shake","timing":[[0,14.634],[1,15.275],[2,15.682],[3,15.927],[4,16.144]]},{"speaker":"kofi","en":"OK. What about the quiet plants?","vi":"Thôi được. Thế còn mấy cây để yên lặng?","ipa":["oʊˈkeɪ","wʌt","əˈbaʊt","ðə","ˈkwaɪət","plænts"],"start":17.444,"end":19.644,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,17.444],[1,18.228],[2,18.309],[3,18.54],[4,18.636],[5,19.03]]},{"speaker":"priya","en":"I don't think they'll grow very much.","vi":"Tớ không nghĩ chúng sẽ lớn nhiều đâu.","ipa":["aɪ","doʊnt","θɪŋk","ðeɪl","ɡɹoʊ","ˈvɛɹi","mʌtʃ"],"start":20.434,"end":22.114,"expression":"thinking","prop":"plant-pot","timing":[[0,20.434],[1,20.516],[2,20.72],[3,20.896],[4,21.073],[5,21.317],[6,21.616]]},{"speaker":"kofi","en":"How tall will they be in six weeks?","vi":"Sáu tuần nữa chúng sẽ cao bao nhiêu?","ipa":["haʊ","tɔl","wɪl","ðeɪ","bi","ɪn","sɪks","wiks"],"start":22.904,"end":24.624,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,22.904],[1,23.009],[2,23.28],[3,23.403],[4,23.538],[5,23.715],[6,23.824],[7,24.109]]},{"speaker":"priya","en":"Maybe twenty centimeters. Maybe a bit more.","vi":"Có lẽ hai mươi phân. Có khi hơn chút.","ipa":["ˈmeɪbi","ˈtwɛnti","ˈsɛntəˌmitɚz","ˈmeɪbi","ə","bɪt","mɔɹ"],"start":25.414,"end":28.404,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,25.414],[1,25.698],[2,26.011],[3,27.238],[4,27.686],[5,27.768],[6,28.012]]},{"speaker":"kofi","en":"And mine will be thirty. I'm sure.","vi":"Còn cây của tớ sẽ cao ba mươi. Chắc chắn luôn.","ipa":["ənd","maɪn","wɪl","bi","ˈθɝˌdi","aɪm","ʃʊɹ"],"start":29.194,"end":31.214,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,29.194],[1,29.281],[2,29.54],[3,29.648],[4,29.784],[5,30.681],[6,30.803]]},{"speaker":"priya","en":"We'll see. Don't forget, the test has to be fair.","vi":"Rồi sẽ biết. Đừng quên, phép thử phải công bằng.","ipa":["wil","si","doʊnt","fɚˈɡɛt","ðə","tɛst","hæz","tu","bi","fɛɹ"],"start":32.004,"end":35.364,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,32.004],[1,32.159],[2,33.006],[3,33.291],[4,33.944],[5,34.052],[6,34.406],[7,34.636],[8,34.732],[9,34.881]]},{"speaker":"kofi","en":"I know. Same light, same water, same boxes.","vi":"Biết rồi. Cùng ánh sáng, cùng nước, cùng hộp.","ipa":["aɪ","noʊ","seɪm","laɪt","seɪm","ˈwɔtɚ","seɪm","ˈbɑksəz"],"start":36.154,"end":39.694,"gesture":"nod","timing":[[0,36.154],[1,36.191],[2,36.965],[3,37.237],[4,37.875],[5,38.147],[6,38.772],[7,39.03]]},{"speaker":"priya","en":"And we write down every result, even the bad ones.","vi":"Và mình ghi lại mọi kết quả, kể cả kết quả xấu.","ipa":["ənd","wi","ɹaɪt","daʊn","ˈɛvɚi","ɹɪˈzʌlt","ˈivɪn","ðə","bæd","wʌnz"],"start":40.484,"end":43.844,"gesture":"explain","prop":"notebook","timing":[[0,40.484],[1,40.643],[2,40.792],[3,41.01],[4,41.485],[5,41.811],[6,42.667],[7,42.912],[8,43.021],[9,43.333]]},{"speaker":"kofi","en":"There won't be any bad ones. My plants will be stars.","vi":"Sẽ chẳng có kết quả xấu nào đâu. Cây của tớ sẽ thành ngôi sao.","ipa":["ðɛɹ","woʊnt","bi","ˈɛni","bæd","wʌnz","maɪ","plænts","wɪl","bi","stɑɹz"],"start":44.634,"end":47.894,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,44.634],[1,44.729],[2,44.946],[3,45.163],[4,45.354],[5,45.652],[6,46.59],[7,46.685],[8,47.038],[9,47.147],[10,47.269]]},{"speaker":"priya","en":"I hope you're right. But I don't think you are.","vi":"Tớ mong cậu nói đúng. Nhưng tớ không nghĩ vậy đâu.","ipa":["aɪ","hoʊp","jʊɹ","ɹaɪt","bʌt","aɪ","doʊnt","θɪŋk","ju","ɑɹ"],"start":48.684,"end":51.434,"expression":"happy","react":{"kofi":"surprised"},"timing":[[0,48.684],[1,48.773],[2,49.004],[3,49.153],[4,49.891],[5,50.421],[6,50.489],[7,50.734],[8,50.91],[9,51.046]]}],"words":[{"id":"grow","en":"grow","ipa":"ɡɹoʊ","vi":"lớn lên; tăng lên; trồng","level":0},{"id":"probably","en":"probably","ipa":"ˈpɹɑbəˌbli","vi":"có lẽ; chắc là","level":1},{"id":"energy","en":"energy","ipa":"ˈɛnɚdʒi","vi":"năng lượng; sức lực; nghị lực","level":3},{"id":"fair","en":"fair","ipa":"fɛɹ","vi":"công bằng; hội chợ; khá","level":0},{"id":"result","en":"result","ipa":"ɹɪˈzʌlt","vi":"kết quả; dẫn đến","level":0},{"id":"forget","en":"forget","ipa":"fɚˈɡɛt","vi":"quên; quên mất","level":0}],"focus":{"title":"Dự đoán tương lai","pattern":"I think … will … · I bet … · … will probably … · I don't think … will … · We'll see.","explain":"\"Will + động từ nguyên mẫu\" để dự đoán: \"The rap plants will win.\" \"I bet…\" = tớ cá là (rất tự tin). \"Probably\" đứng sau \"will\": \"They'll probably grow.\" Nói không đồng ý nhẹ nhàng: \"I don't think they'll grow\" (tự nhiên hơn \"I think they won't…\"). \"We'll see\" = để rồi xem.","keys":["i think","i bet","probably","i don't think","we'll see"],"lines":[1,2,4,7,11,15]},"audio":{"src":"/audio/library/videos/vd-a2-the-music-experiment.mp3","v":"8cff875de7","duration":52.536,"fps":25,"mouth":""}}